---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="French Riviera Tips | Cookies Policy | French Riviera" description="How and why French Riviera Tips uses cookies.">
  <main class="wrap" style="padding-top:40px;max-width:760px;padding-bottom:40px">
    <nav style="font-size:13px;color:var(--faint);display:flex;gap:8px"><a href="/">Home</a><span>/</span><span>Cookies policy</span></nav>
    <h1 style="font-weight:800;font-size:38px;letter-spacing:-0.03em;margin-top:20px">Cookies policy</h1>
    <p style="color:var(--faint);font-size:13px;margin-top:8px">Last updated: July 2026</p>
    <div class="prose" style="margin-top:20px">
      <p>This site uses a minimal set of cookies to function and to help us improve our guides.</p>
      <h2>Types of cookies we use</h2>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Essential:</strong> required for the site to work. These cannot be switched off.</li>
        <li><strong>Analytics:</strong> help us understand which pages are popular, in aggregate.</li>
        <li><strong>Affiliate / partner:</strong> when you follow an affiliate link, our partners may set their own cookies to attribute a booking. These are governed by the partner's own policies.</li>
      </ul>
      <h2>Managing cookies</h2>
      <p>You can control or delete cookies through your browser settings at any time. Blocking some cookies may affect how parts of the site work.</p>
    </div>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>
